Watch's 1,024 limit'","norm_id":"nd872c744a325c8c4","priority":0.2933,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["Author duplicates an invariant already covered, creating two guards that can disagree (bytes vs chars) for any future non-ASCII description","Reviewer cannot tell whether the new check supersedes, complements, or conflicts with the established byte-limit test"],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"Either drop the duplicate length check and rely on the existing byte-limit test, or state explicitly why a character-based check is additionally needed and align it to UTF-8 bytes to match CloudWatch's validation.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.6667,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"yes","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"no","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"medium","divergent_implementation":"incomplete_enumeration","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"medium","prod_impact":"none","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"self_revealing","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}},{"block_threshold":0.95,"blocking_enabled":false,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Reconcile the limit units before adding any length check: the authoritative cap is bytes (test_alarm_description_byte_limit.py), so do not re-assert a weaker character-based check.","cohort":["A1"],"criteria":["A1"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":-0.785,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["tests/unit/test_alarm_description_byte_limit.py:15 _ALARM_DESCRIPTION_BYTE_LIMIT = 1024 with byte_count = len(value.encode('utf-8')) — AWS validates in UTF-8 bytes per that file's docstring.","tests/unit/test_alarm_actions_terraform.py:457 _AWS_ALARM_DESCRIPTION_MAX = 1024 measured as len(rendered) characters."],"finding":"The plan states the limit as '1,024 effective characters', but the existing guards disagree on units — one enforces 1024 characters and one 1024 bytes — so re-asserting a character-based check without reconciling units risks a guard that diverges from the byte-based one for multibyte descriptions.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f991845af34ca28d7","impact":0.33,"is_primary":null,"location":"Verification ('Longest effective description ... is 1,021 characters against CloudWatch's 1,024 limit'); Approach step 2 ('exceeds 1,024 effective characters')","norm_id":"n9743ab20043807b7","priority":0.165,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["A description with multibyte UTF-8 characters at ~1,020 chars but >1,024 bytes passes a char-based check and fails the byte-based one."],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.5,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"no","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"low","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"none","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_re